    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1039">

                <pb facs="1085" n="965" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg965"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">853.00 Revolution 1931/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Funchal</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Huddleston</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Funchal</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-10T16:00:00-01:00">April 10, 1931—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 10—3:40 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>I regret if plan has caused Department embarrassment. Will relieve Department and
                    Minister Lisbon of any and all responsibility and will make full apologies in
                    accordance with any instructions to be received from Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Huddleston</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
